  "title": "Cream Cheese Chicken",
  "description": "In this chicken recipe with cream cheese, boneless breasts are pounded thin, then stuffed with a mushroom and cream cheese mixture. The rolls are coated with brown sugar and Dijon and rolled in chopped nuts before baking.",
  "authors": [
    "Jenny"
  ],
